# The hermes-agent and litellm Dockerfiles build from the repo root —
# keep the context to what they COPY (docker/hermes/, config/, render.py).
# There is NO committed build/ output anymore: render.py runs inside the
# agent image build. Note: Komodo Builds clone the repo fresh, so
# gitignored files never reach the host-side context anyway; this guards
# the local `mise run up` build path.
.git
mise.local.toml
secrets/*.env
build
admin-api-key.txt
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
.claude